flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[User opens app]
    B --> C[Login / Signup]
    C --> D{Authenticated?}
    D -- No --> E[Show auth error]
    D -- Yes --> F[User enters chat prompt]
    F --> G{Premium access?}
    G -- No --> H[Check free quota]
    H --> I{Quota available?}
    I -- No --> J[Return 403 / upgrade prompt]
    I -- Yes --> K[Send request to AI service]
    G -- Yes --> K[Send request to AI service]
    K --> L{Gemini available?}
    L -- Yes --> M[Return Gemini response]
    L -- No --> N[Try Hugging Face fallback]
    N --> O{Fallback available?}
    O -- Yes --> P[Return fallback response]
    O -- No --> Q[Return error message]
    M --> R[Save chat to database]
    P --> R
    R --> S[Show response to user]
    S --> T([End])